{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40115,"sections":[{"id":"script-20115","name":"原始脚本 20115","scripts":[20115],"start":0,"count":20}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:0","scriptId":20115,"text":"好在黑色闪电小队的及时赶到，我们这边避免了团灭……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:1","scriptId":20115,"text":"“恩，都干得不错，那我现在把大家送回现实世界咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:2","scriptId":20115,"text":"“我记得还有一支队伍吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:3","scriptId":20115,"text":"“哦，那个啊，她们已经先回去了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:4","scriptId":20115,"text":"“什么？？这都可以？？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:5","scriptId":20115,"text":"“她们处理掉了一些入侵的数据，足够了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:6","scriptId":20115,"text":"“好吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:7","scriptId":20115,"text":"“那么我们就回去咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:10","scriptId":20115,"text":"于是我们就从模拟世界回到了现实世界……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:11","scriptId":20115,"text":"这次的征召任务终于划上了句号。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:12","scriptId":20115,"text":"“这任务简直是模拟版的演习，对手还是蕾贝卡……教官……阿芙罗拉……地狱难度……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":642,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:13","scriptId":20115,"text":"“有吗？还可以吧，阿芙罗拉即使只是数据都那么棘手，真是值得一战啊～你们小队也还不错嘛，蕾贝卡和教官都能战胜。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":642,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:14","scriptId":20115,"text":"“过奖过奖……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":642,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:15","scriptId":20115,"text":"看到黑色闪电小队的队员一个个都充满满足的表情，我也不好继续再多说什么……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":642,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:16","scriptId":20115,"text":"“那么……报酬……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":642,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:17","scriptId":20115,"text":"“已经都告知芮蓓了，自己去领吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:18","scriptId":20115,"text":"事后——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:19","scriptId":20115,"text":"通过这次的模拟数据收集，波西娅又开发出了不少新品种的舞装，不过这都是后话了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:20","scriptId":20115,"text":"（钢舞姬之间的战斗也是值得收集的数据啊，舞装还有很多的改良空间……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20115:20115:21","scriptId":20115,"text":"（只是那个突然入侵的数据堆到底是怎么回事，虽然只是拿到一些奇怪的数据，但是还远远够不够做研究的……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
